@startuml state-expense
!include _style.iuml
title Expense - State diagram

[*] --> DRAFT : create (owner, policy valid)
DRAFT --> DRAFT : edit (owner)
DRAFT --> [*] : delete (owner)
DRAFT --> SUBMITTED : submit (owner)\n[no policy violations]
SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : approve (dept manager / admin)\n[not own expense, budget not exceeded]
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : reject (dept manager / admin)\n[reason required]
REJECTED --> DRAFT : reopen (owner)
APPROVED --> REIMBURSED : reimburse (admin)\nsp_mark_reimbursed(until)
REIMBURSED --> [*]

APPROVED : entry / trg_expense_budget adds amount to project.spent
@enduml
